            "review_text": "Scott_and_Jessica\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam108 contributions\n0\nMediocre food, above average\nJan 2021\nMediocre food, above average service, and a decent play area for kids. \n\nThe most frustrating part about this place is the few times we have tried to use a gift voucher they always have an excuse why we can’t use it on that day. “You can’t use it if you ordered any drink on happy hour”, “it’s a holiday”, etc... I asked to separate the bills so happy hour is on one and all our food is on another, but “we can’t do that because it’s already on one bill”. Today it’s New Years Day and there were only 15 people in the entire restaurant. There were no special deals for NY so why can’t I use the 200k voucher on my 1 mil bill? Nowhere on the voucher does it say anything about holiday.\nRead more\nWritten January 1, 2021",
