            "review_title": "Review at Jaspas",
            "review_text": "Climber766406\n3 contributions\n1\nAnother great addition to the A Fresco Group in Vietnam\nNov 2018 • Friends\nDo expect a warm greeting by English speaking staff, great service, new well considered and maintained decor. Do expect the Jaspas standard of service, presentation and range of menu choices Good wine list with many well respected, popular Australian at reasonable prices. We enjoyed an excellent meal with friends and left with nothing but positive thoughts. We enjoyed steaks, pasta dishes and fat noodles which all came in beautifully presented and tasting as they should. Salad and chips as sides were excellent also. The children’s playground is a great bonus for those with little ones. The restrooms are spotless and well supplied and located well away from the eating and cooking areas. Would go back any time.\nDo NOT expect cheap eats at Jaspas. All of their venues are great western standard with well trained and friendly staff. If you want this standard you must pay a little more than the corner noodle shop. well done Jaspas\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 7, 2018",
